      className="min-h-screen bg-center bg-cover text-white"
      style={{
        backgroundImage: `url(${backgroundImage})`,
        backgroundSize: "cover",
        backgroundPosition: "center",
      }}
    >
      <div className="bg-black bg-opacity-70 min-h-screen p-8 flex flex-col justify-center">
        <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
          {/* Left Side */}
          <div>
            <h1 className="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
              🌱 The Importance of Agriculture
            </h1>
            <p className="text-lg mb-6">
              Agriculture is the backbone of Tamil Nadu’s economy, supporting millions of livelihoods and ensuring food security across the state.
            </p>
            <h2 className="text-2xl font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-2">
              தன் செய்பயிர்ச்சி
            </h2>
            <p className="text-md mb-6">
              AI tools can provide farmers with data-driven recommendations and insights, helping them make more informed farming decisions.
            </p>
            <Link to="/dashboard">
              <button className="bg-white text-green-700 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg shadow-md font-semibold hover:bg-green-200 transition">
                🚜 Try the Crop Predictor
              </button>
            </Link>
          </div>

          {/* Right Side */}
          <div>
            <h1 className="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">
              🌾 Rich in Diverse Crops
            </h1>
            <h2 className="text-2xl font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-2">
              தெளிவுமா பயிர்கள்
            </h2>
            <p className="text-lg mb-6">
              Tamil Nadu is home to a wide variety of crops — rice, maize, sugarcane, and millets — contributing significantly to its agricultural output.
            </p>
            <h2 className="text-2xl font-semibold text-yellow-400 mb-2">
              🤖 Why Use AI?
            </h2>
            <p className="text-lg">
              AI can guide farmers with smart insights to reduce costs, improve productivity, and make farming sustainable.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Footer */}
        <footer className="text-center text-sm text-white mt-12 opacity-70">
          ©2025 Tamil Nadu Crop Advisor. All rights reserved.
        </footer>
      </div>
